# Personal nano settings.
#
# No `include` lines here on purpose: nano errors out at startup on a pattern that
# matches nothing, and the path to the bundled syntax files is platform-specific
# (/usr/share/nano on Linux, /opt/homebrew/share/nano on Apple Silicon). The nano
# package ships its own system nanorc that already includes them - /etc/nanorc on
# Linux distros, $(brew --prefix)/etc/nanorc under Homebrew - so highlighting works
# without any help from this file. See the nano note in README.md.
#
# Colours are left exactly as the bundled syntax files define them. To change one,
# re-declare its rule here, e.g.:
#   extendsyntax sh color #695 "(^|[[:blank:]])#.*"
